    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/fdba426e6f7f51f3da4a2537faef1912.poster.avif?t=1751354238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/fdba426e6f7f51f3da4a2537faef1912.webm?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/fdba426e6f7f51f3da4a2537faef1912.mp4?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Voden's Job</i> is a small <strong>roguelike deckbuilding game</strong> where you have 7 rounds of experiments to collect enough DNA to evolve your specimen. Between each experiment, you can <strong>upgrade</strong> your deck with new cards, combos, and strange tools. The catch? Upgrading costs DNA, so you'll need to <strong>carefully balance</strong> how much you're willing to spend each round.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/c8aab8d2aaf8b2730fe38a8c52f81e80.poster.avif?t=1751354238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/c8aab8d2aaf8b2730fe38a8c52f81e80.webm?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/c8aab8d2aaf8b2730fe38a8c52f81e80.mp4?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The <strong>rules</strong> are <strong>simple</strong>: each experiment round is about playing Mutation cards until you run out of options. Mutation cards have a cost, paid with Eye cards, and each one has a different effect, like drawing more cards or gaining DNA. A Mutation is too <strong>weak</strong>? Just throw in some Enzyme cards to unleash <strong>powerful combos</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/3bca93585853bf1f2bab2be9b15a7e05.poster.avif?t=1751354238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/3bca93585853bf1f2bab2be9b15a7e05.webm?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/3bca93585853bf1f2bab2be9b15a7e05.mp4?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 37 unique cards, including Mutation, Eye, and Enzyme types<br></li><li> 5 powerful tools to amplify card effects and tilt the odds in your favor<br></li><li> Fast-paced, streamlined gameplay<br></li><li> Endless replayability: each round is different<br></li><li> Atmospheric soundtrack mixed with splatter-style sound design<br></li><li> Rich pixel art visuals with plenty of juicy effects</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/fdba426e6f7f51f3da4a2537faef1912.poster.avif?t=1751354238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/fdba426e6f7f51f3da4a2537faef1912.webm?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/fdba426e6f7f51f3da4a2537faef1912.mp4?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Voden's Job</i> is a small <strong>roguelike deckbuilding game</strong> where you have 7 rounds of experiments to collect enough DNA to evolve your specimen. Between each experiment, you can <strong>upgrade</strong> your deck with new cards, combos, and strange tools. The catch? Upgrading costs DNA, so you'll need to <strong>carefully balance</strong> how much you're willing to spend each round.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/c8aab8d2aaf8b2730fe38a8c52f81e80.poster.avif?t=1751354238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/c8aab8d2aaf8b2730fe38a8c52f81e80.webm?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/c8aab8d2aaf8b2730fe38a8c52f81e80.mp4?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The <strong>rules</strong> are <strong>simple</strong>: each experiment round is about playing Mutation cards until you run out of options. Mutation cards have a cost, paid with Eye cards, and each one has a different effect, like drawing more cards or gaining DNA. A Mutation is too <strong>weak</strong>? Just throw in some Enzyme cards to unleash <strong>powerful combos</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/3bca93585853bf1f2bab2be9b15a7e05.poster.avif?t=1751354238\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/3bca93585853bf1f2bab2be9b15a7e05.webm?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/3bca93585853bf1f2bab2be9b15a7e05.mp4?t=1751354238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 37 unique cards, including Mutation, Eye, and Enzyme types<br></li><li> 5 powerful tools to amplify card effects and tilt the odds in your favor<br></li><li> Fast-paced, streamlined gameplay<br></li><li> Endless replayability: each round is different<br></li><li> Atmospheric soundtrack mixed with splatter-style sound design<br></li><li> Rich pixel art visuals with plenty of juicy effects</li></ul>",
